  "details": "Every once in a while whenever I try to join a world, I will get the error message that I had trouble connecting to VRChat. After that, VRChat will try to rejoin the same world and at that point will start spamming the error message so quickly that it doesn't have a chance to appear and makes an awful noise.\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Go to your world menu\n\n3. Join any world in an invite+ instance\n\nI have a video clip of this, but it's 2 MB too big to attach directly, so here's a dropbox link.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/6b60qxr31ssree477g9ha/really-strange-vrchat-bug.mp4?rlkey=cx2vbe060p89znncmf9bt3oy5&st=awla8dkz&dl=0",
